    "features": "<p>Unlike the maneuverable combat drone, the combat mech is more like a walking tank: 4 meters tall, 9 tons, and equipped with advanced weaponry. It requires a human pilot to operate, seated inside, although a clever computer specialist could program a remote-operated or even self-directed mech. Their weaponry is intended for vehicles and ground-based installations, making them lethal for human opponents.</p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Expose, Knock Prone, Penetrate Hull, Suppressive Fire, Overcome Toughness</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 8</p>",
